{"seq":2,"slug":"excursion-broken-chain-disposition","title":"断链超温事故处置与货损判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cold-chain-temperature-controlled-logistics/cold-chain-ops-compliance/excursion-broken-chain-disposition","wordCount":3021,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"断链超温事故处置与货损判定\">断链超温事故处置与货损判定</h1><p>一批 2–8 ℃ 的单克隆抗体在法兰克福中转仓因冷库故障暴露在 21 ℃ 达 9 小时。追踪系统报警时，货已上了下一程航班。此时摆在质量部门（QA）面前的不是「记不记录这次超温」，而是：<strong>这批货还能不能放行，谁来定，凭什么定，判定书怎么写才能在客户审计和监管检查里站得住。</strong> 本文给出跨境链路里断链事故从触发到结案的处置骨架、货损判定的三条技术路径、责任划分与索赔、审计证据链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-断链处置的产物不是一张曲线-是一份判定\">核心概念：断链处置的产物不是一张曲线，是一份判定</h2><p>超温本身只是一个事件；<strong>断链事故（broken chain incident / excursion）指的是这个事件已越过「可解释的扰动」这条线，需要正式立案调查。</strong> 判定它是否构成事故、货品是否受损，靠三样东西的交叉：<strong>温度证据的完整性</strong>（曲线有没有断、记录仪校准是否有效）、<strong>货品的耐受度预算</strong>（还剩多少热暴露余量）、<strong>可援引的判定依据</strong>（稳定性数据、耐受度模型、复现试验）。</p>\n<p>跨境场景把这三样同时复杂化：曲线可能跨三个时区、承运方换了两次、监管要求因目的国而异。所以流程必须先固定一个名词体系——超温（excursion）、隔离（quarantine）、放行（release）、降级（downgrade）、报废（reject）、调查（investigation）、CAPA——否则法务、QA、货代、客户四方的对话根本对不上。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>处置的分工边界：「事件是否发生」由<a href=\"../temperature-monitoring-chain/realtime-monitoring-alerting\">实时温控监测与超温预警闭环机制</a>负责；本文接手「事件已被识别为事故之后怎么办」。支持判定所需的原始曲线、交接记录与冻结点证据，其采集与移交由<a href=\"cold-chain-handover-sop\">冷链交接作业规程</a>约束；判定所需的量化口径（等效时间、MKT）在<a href=\"../cold-chain-requirements-products/time-temperature-tolerance-model\">温度-时间耐受度模型与平均动力学温度</a>中定义。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"事故分级-先定级-再决定用多重的流程\">事故分级：先定级，再决定用多重的流程</h2><p>把每一次 8.5 ℃ 的 30 秒抖动都拉进全流程调查会让 QA 淹没在工单里；把所有超温都当「观察一下」处理，则会在监管检查时暴露系统性缺陷。实务做法是<strong>按越界幅度、持续时长、累积剂量三维分级</strong>，级别直接决定响应时限与审批层级。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>典型触发条件</th>\n<th>响应时限</th>\n<th>处置权限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一级（提示）</td>\n<td>单点越界，幅度 ≤1 ℃，时长 &lt;15 min</td>\n<td>24 h 内复核</td>\n<td>值班操作员记录，无需 QA 立案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二级（偏差）</td>\n<td>幅度 ≤3 ℃ 且时长 &lt;4 h；或累积剂量未超预算 50%</td>\n<td>4 h 内响应</td>\n<td>QA 立案调查，可否放行需 QA 签字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三级（事故）</td>\n<td>幅度 &gt;3 ℃；或时长 ≥4 h；或累积剂量逼近/超预算</td>\n<td>1 h 内响应，冻结放行</td>\n<td>QA + 质量负责人（QP/RP）联合判定，触发 CAPA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>分级阈值必须写进质量体系文件并与合同绑定：承运方一旦签收，就承接了对应级别的通知义务。</strong> 跨境链路最常见的争议恰在时区差里发生——发货方按北京时间判定为三级，承运方按当地上班时间 8 小时后才立案，货早已转手。规避手段是<strong>在运输合同里约定「超温告警触发即以 UTC 时间戳立案」，并指定 24 小时值守的联系入口</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>回传中断必须按最差假设定级。</strong> 一条 8 小时没有新数据的曲线和「8 小时恒温」在数据上无法区分，因此监测系统要对回传超时单独触发告警，并<strong>默认按该时段温度已越界处理</strong>，直到补传数据证明其清白。这个「有罪推定」是防止断链被静默掩盖的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处置流程-从冻结放行到结案\">处置流程：从冻结放行到结案</h2><p>事故立案后进入一条有固定节点的流水线。每个节点都要产出<strong>带时间戳、责任人和附件的记录</strong>，因为最终判定书要能被还原成一条完整的事实链。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[监测系统触发超温告警] --&gt; B[按幅度 时长 剂量自动分级]&#10;  B --&gt; C{级别}&#10;  C --&gt;|一级| D[操作员复核曲线 确认误报]&#10;  C --&gt;|二级/三级| E[系统冻结该批货放行状态]&#10;  E --&gt; F[QA 立案 生成调查工单]&#10;  F --&gt; G[收齐证据 曲线 校准证书 交接记录 装箱SOP]&#10;  G --&gt; H[计算耐受度余量 等效时间 与 MKT]&#10;  H --&gt; I{是否仍在预算内}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[判定可放行 附条件缩短有效期]&#10;  I --&gt;|否或存疑| K[复现试验 或 送第三方检测]&#10;  K --&gt; L{检测结论}&#10;  L --&gt;|合格| J&#10;  L --&gt;|不合格| M[降级/报废 隔离销毁]&#10;  J --&gt; N[QA 与 QP/RP 签字 出具判定书]&#10;  M --&gt; N&#10;  N --&gt; O[关闭工单 触发 CAPA 与索赔]&#10;  O --&gt; P[回写证据链 归档]\">flowchart TD\n  A[监测系统触发超温告警] --&gt; B[按幅度 时长 剂量自动分级]\n  B --&gt; C{级别}\n  C --&gt;|一级| D[操作员复核曲线 确认误报]\n  C --&gt;|二级/三级| E[系统冻结该批货放行状态]\n  E --&gt; F[QA 立案 生成调查工单]\n  F --&gt; G[收齐证据 曲线 校准证书 交接记录 装箱SOP]\n  G --&gt; H[计算耐受度余量 等效时间 与 MKT]\n  H --&gt; I{是否仍在预算内}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[判定可放行 附条件缩短有效期]\n  I --&gt;|否或存疑| K[复现试验 或 送第三方检测]\n  K --&gt; L{检测结论}\n  L --&gt;|合格| J\n  L --&gt;|不合格| M[降级/报废 隔离销毁]\n  J --&gt; N[QA 与 QP/RP 签字 出具判定书]\n  M --&gt; N\n  N --&gt; O[关闭工单 触发 CAPA 与索赔]\n  O --&gt; P[回写证据链 归档]</pre><p>流程里两个容易被跳过的节点恰是审计高危点：<strong>证据收齐</strong>（校准证书过期会让整条曲线失去证明力）与 <strong>CAPA</strong>（只处理这一批货、不修正根因，同类事故会复发）。CAPA 要回答「为什么冷库会故障、为什么告警 8 小时才被看到」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"货损判定的三条技术路径\">货损判定的三条技术路径</h2><p>「超温了所以报废」是外行话——很多超温对货品的实际影响为零，一刀切报废造成巨大浪费；「看起来没坏就放行」则可能把降解了 30% 效价的货送进患者手里。判定要在<strong>报废的风险</strong>与<strong>放行的风险</strong>之间取一个有数据支撑的结论。主流三条路径，按成本与确定性递进使用。</p>\n<p><strong>路径一：稳定性数据外推（最省，最快）。</strong> 药品的注册稳定性数据（ICH Q1A(R2)）包含「加速试验」与「长期试验」，前者故意在 25 ℃/60%RH、40 ℃/75%RH 下考察降解趋势。<strong>若本次超温的幅度与时长远在被考察过的加速条件以内，且稳定性数据证明该暴露下关键质量属性仍在规格内，就可直接援引数据放行。</strong> ICH Q1E 进一步允许在统计有效的前提下做有限外推，给出「缩短后的有效期」。前提是产品在目的国有完整的注册稳定性档案。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：耐受度模型量化（需与路径一互证）。</strong> 把温度记录折算成一个标量再与预算比较，是跨境链路最实操的做法。常用口径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>累积等效时间</strong>：把每一小段时长按 Arrhenius 因子折算到参考温度，<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{eq} = \\sum_i \\Delta t_i \\cdot \\exp\\left[\\frac{E_a}{R}\\left(\\frac{1}{T_{ref}} - \\frac{1}{T_i}\\right)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为活化能、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 为气体常数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 用开尔文。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{eq}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超出热预算即触发路径三。</li>\n<li><strong>累积剂量（degree-minutes）</strong>：仅对越界段积分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = \\sum_{T_i &gt; T_{lim}} (T_i - T_{lim})\\,\\Delta t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1556em;vertical-align:-0.4056em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4056em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，直观、适合一线分流，但忽略 Arrhenius 指数特性，不宜单独作为报废依据。</li>\n<li><strong>平均动力学温度（MKT）</strong>：反解「哪个恒温能产生同样的总降解」，得到单一等效温度与温区阈值直接比较。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>路径三：复现试验或第三方检测（最贵，最确定）。</strong> 当模型结论落在灰区（等效时间刚好触线、或活性成分对温度敏感度未知），必须用实物证据定案：按最坏剖面在试验箱内复现该超温历程，再检测关键质量属性（含量、效价、有关物质、无菌、pH）；食品对应微生物与感官/理化检测。这条路周期长（常 2–6 周）、成本高，但它是唯一能对「未知敏感度」给出确定答案的方式。判定结论必须<strong>可归因</strong>：写清用了哪条路径、依据哪份数据、在什么置信水平下成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"责任划分与索赔-承运方-发货方与货代的三角\">责任划分与索赔：承运方、发货方与货代的三角</h2><p>超温造成的货损，钱最后由谁出，取决于<strong>责任在交付链的哪一段断裂</strong>，以及<strong>合同与公约怎么限制赔偿</strong>。跨境货运的赔偿上限往往远低于货值，必须在发货前通过保险或声明价值处理。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运输方式</th>\n<th>适用规则</th>\n<th>赔偿上限（典型）</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空运</td>\n<td>《蒙特利尔公约》（1999）</td>\n<td>约 22 SDR/kg</td>\n<td>高价值生物制品常远低于货值，需声明价值或投保</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公路（欧洲）</td>\n<td>CMR 公约</td>\n<td>约 8.33 SDR/kg</td>\n<td>按重量计，与货值脱钩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海运</td>\n<td>《海牙-维斯比规则》/ 各国海商法</td>\n<td>按件或按公斤</td>\n<td>冷链货物索赔门槛高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快递/货代</td>\n<td>承运人服务条款</td>\n<td>申报价值或固定上限</td>\n<td>免税/低值货常默认极低上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>举证责任是索赔的胜负手。</strong> 承运方通常主张「交付时外包装完好、温度记录由发货方提供、无法证明超温发生在自己承运段」。破解方式是<strong>把责任边界切成可归属的时间段</strong>：每一段交接（装箱、提货、装机、中转入库、清关、派送）都要有交接温度读数与密封状态记录，某段曲线出现断点或异常即可锁定责任段。装箱密封条编号与记录仪序列号的一致性是关键证据。\n<strong>保险与声明价值要前置。</strong> 多数标准货运险把<strong>温度变化导致的损失列为除外责任</strong>，需要单独投保专门险种或在保单中明确加保。发货方应在订舱阶段就确认：保单是否覆盖温度致损、免赔额多少、理赔需要哪些单证。事后补保无效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证据链与审计-判定书要经得起回溯\">证据链与审计：判定书要经得起回溯</h2><p>跨境断链处置的证据最终会面临两类检查：<strong>客户的供应商审计</strong>与<strong>监管机构的现场检查</strong>。二者看的都是同一件事——<strong>证据链是否满足 ALCOA+ 原则</strong>（可归属、清晰、同步、原始、准确，外加完整、一致、持久、可获得）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>电子记录合规。</strong> 用于合规判定的温度数据、调查工单、判定书，在很多司法辖区受 <strong>21 CFR Part 11</strong>（美国）与 <strong>EU GMP Annex 11</strong>（欧盟）约束，要求审计追踪不可关闭、访问受控、时间戳可信、签名与记录绑定。一个能被后台改数的记录仪数据，在检查中不具备证明力。</li>\n<li><strong>调查记录的完整性。</strong> 一份合格的超温调查报告至少包含：事件描述、时间线（含 UTC 与本地时间）、受影响批次与数量、温度证据与校准状态、判定路径与计算过程、结论与理由、CAPA 编号、签字日期。两类体系对偏差记录的字段要求不同，见<a href=\"../cold-chain-requirements-products/cold-chain-standards-gdp-haccp\">药品 GDP 与食品 HACCP 冷链标准要求</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>验证结论要能复现。</strong> 若判定依据来自<a href=\"../thermal-packaging-equipment/packaging-qualification-seasonal-test\">包装温控验证试验</a>的季别测试报告，该报告需在有效期内，且事故场景未超出验证时定义的「最坏情况」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"跨境专有难点-时区-数据主权与召回\">跨境专有难点：时区、数据主权与召回</h2><p>国内断链处置的直觉到了跨境链路会集体失效，三个坑最典型。<strong>时区错位</strong>：判定窗口必须以 UTC 存储、展示层再本地化，否则跨时区的曲线拼接会错位，把责任判错段。<strong>数据主权</strong>：部分国家要求温度数据本地存储或不得出境，若平台把所有曲线集中存到单一区域云端，可能同时违反目的国本地化要求与来源国出境规定——设计上要做区域化存储 + 汇总层脱敏，判定所需的原始曲线留在本地。<strong>监管通报与召回</strong>：若结论是「已流入市场的货品存在质量风险」，触发的是召回而非内部处置——药品按目的国药监的召回分级与通报程序执行，食品按食品安全法规定报告并公告。判定书应同步评估受影响批次是否已出境、流向哪些市场，否则一次产品事故会升级为一次监管事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>断链超温处置的核心不是「把温度记下来」，而是<strong>在证据完整的前提下，用最省的路径得出一个能经得起回溯的判定</strong>。四件事必须闭环：分级决定流程重量，量化决定放行还是报废，交接记录决定索赔归属，审计追踪决定判定书有没有证明力。跨境场景额外叠加时区、数据主权与召回半径——它们不改变技术方法，但决定判定做完后还要走多远。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"断链超温事故处置与货损判定","id":"断链超温事故处置与货损判定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：断链处置的产物不是一张曲线，是一份判定","id":"核心概念-断链处置的产物不是一张曲线-是一份判定"},{"level":2,"text":"事故分级：先定级，再决定用多重的流程","id":"事故分级-先定级-再决定用多重的流程"},{"level":2,"text":"处置流程：从冻结放行到结案","id":"处置流程-从冻结放行到结案"},{"level":2,"text":"货损判定的三条技术路径","id":"货损判定的三条技术路径"},{"level":2,"text":"责任划分与索赔：承运方、发货方与货代的三角","id":"责任划分与索赔-承运方-发货方与货代的三角"},{"level":2,"text":"证据链与审计：判定书要经得起回溯","id":"证据链与审计-判定书要经得起回溯"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境专有难点：时区、数据主权与召回","id":"跨境专有难点-时区-数据主权与召回"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"冷链仓储、干线运输与末端交付作业SOP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cold-chain-temperature-controlled-logistics/cold-chain-ops-compliance/cold-chain-handover-sop"},"next":{"title":"冷链质量指标、承运商考核与合规审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cold-chain-temperature-controlled-logistics/cold-chain-ops-compliance/cold-chain-kpi-audit-compliance"}}